Roger,

I had Java 8 installed prior to the Yosemite upgrade, and had problems with JGR after upgrading to Yosemite. It occurs to me that I may have needed to remove Java before installing Apple's Java to get everything working properly, following the instructions at https://www.java.com/en/download/help/mac_uninstall_java.xml

Regards,

Tom

